{"id":"0a60d76d37648fa4","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-pblplinearization.md","title":"PBNF的符号敏感线性化","display":"df-pblplinearization — PBNF的符号敏感线性化","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-pblplinearization","aliases":["27-df-pblplinearization"],"display":"df-pblplinearization — PBNF的符号敏感线性化","depends_on":["[[27-df-pbnf]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"13.4.3","source_printed_pages":"589","source_pdf_pages":"613","verification_status":"source-definition-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-pblplinearization"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-pblplinearization</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-pblplinearization — PBNF的符号敏感线性化"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"34c60c3bc15859dd\" href=\"?note=34c60c3bc15859dd\" title=\"27-df-pbnf\">27-df-pbnf</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"13.4.3"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"589"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"613"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-definition-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n,m\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n,m\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N=[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\">\\(N=[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P=(b_0,(b_k,A_k,B_k)_{k=1}^m)\\in\\mathrm{PBNF}_n\">\\(P=(b_0,(b_k,A_k,B_k)_{k=1}^m)\\in\\mathrm{PBNF}_n\\)</span>（见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"34c60c3bc15859dd\" href=\"?note=34c60c3bc15859dd\" title=\"27-df-pbnf\">27-df-pbnf</a>）。空和为0。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"K_+\\coloneqq\\{k\\in[m]:b_k&gt;0\\},\\qquad K_-\\coloneqq\\{k\\in[m]:b_k&lt;0\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[K_+\\coloneqq\\{k\\in[m]:b_k&gt;0\\},\\qquad K_-\\coloneqq\\{k\\in[m]:b_k&lt;0\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L(P)\\coloneqq\\left\\{(x,y)\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\times\\{0,1\\}^m\\ \\middle|\\\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\forall k\\in K_+\\;((\\forall i\\in A_k\\;y_k\\le x_i)\\land(\\forall j\\in B_k\\;y_k\\le1-x_j)),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall k\\in K_-\\;\\left(y_k\\ge1-|A_k|+\\sum_{i\\in A_k}x_i-\\sum_{j\\in B_k}x_j\\right)\n\\end{aligned}\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal L(P)\\coloneqq\\left\\{(x,y)\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\times\\{0,1\\}^m\\ \\middle|\\\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\forall k\\in K_+\\;((\\forall i\\in A_k\\;y_k\\le x_i)\\land(\\forall j\\in B_k\\;y_k\\le1-x_j)),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall k\\in K_-\\;\\left(y_k\\ge1-|A_k|+\\sum_{i\\in A_k}x_i-\\sum_{j\\in B_k}x_j\\right)\n\\end{aligned}\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"F_P:\\{0,1\\}^n\\times\\{0,1\\}^m\\to\\mathbb R,\\qquad F_P(x,y)\\coloneqq b_0+\\sum_{k=1}^m b_ky_k.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[F_P:\\{0,1\\}^n\\times\\{0,1\\}^m\\to\\mathbb R,\\qquad F_P(x,y)\\coloneqq b_0+\\sum_{k=1}^m b_ky_k.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对应Theorem 13.13。保留每个非零系数所需的单侧约束；零系数项不需要约束。辅助变量与原变量均为二元。不假定任意可行解都满足文字积等式：非零系数项的最优取值才被目标强制为文字积。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-pbnf","status":"resolved","id":"34c60c3bc15859dd","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-pbnf]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-pbnf","status":"resolved","id":"34c60c3bc15859dd","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n,m\\in\\mathbb N$，$N=[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}$，$P=(b_0,(b_k,A_k,B_k)_{k=1}^m)\\in\\mathrm{PBNF}_n$（见 [[27-df-pbnf]]）。空和为0。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n,m\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"N=[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"P=(b_0,(b_k,A_k,B_k)_{k=1}^m)\\in\\mathrm{PBNF}_n","display":false},{"tex":"K_+\\coloneqq\\{k\\in[m]:b_k>0\\},\\qquad K_-\\coloneqq\\{k\\in[m]:b_k<0\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal L(P)\\coloneqq\\left\\{(x,y)\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\times\\{0,1\\}^m\\ \\middle|\\\n\\begin{aligned}\n&\\forall k\\in K_+\\;((\\forall i\\in A_k\\;y_k\\le x_i)\\land(\\forall j\\in B_k\\;y_k\\le1-x_j)),\\\\\n&\\forall k\\in K_-\\;\\left(y_k\\ge1-|A_k|+\\sum_{i\\in A_k}x_i-\\sum_{j\\in B_k}x_j\\right)\n\\end{aligned}\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"F_P:\\{0,1\\}^n\\times\\{0,1\\}^m\\to\\mathbb R,\\qquad F_P(x,y)\\coloneqq b_0+\\sum_{k=1}^m b_ky_k.","display":true}],"bytes":1539,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-123","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[27-df-pblplinearization|df-pblplinearization — PBNF的符号敏感线性化]]"},{"id":"adff775aa909263a","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n,m\\in\\mathbb N$，$P=(b_0,(b_k,A_k,B_k)_{k=1}^m)\\in\\mathrm{PBNF}_n$，$f=\\mathrm{PBEval}_n(P)$；$F_P,\\mathcal L(P)$ 见 [[27-df-pblplinearization]]，$\\mathrm{PBNF}_n,\\mathrm{PBEval}_n$ 取其上游 [[27-df-pbnf]]。"}],"outgoing":["34c60c3bc15859dd"]}